<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RFID</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RFID manufacturing — cards, tags and inlays</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures smart cards, tags, inlays and tire tags across LF, HF and UHF, supported by more than 20 years of RFID design and manufacturing experience. Automated roll-to-roll inlay lines in China and the USA support high-volume production across multiple RFID form factors.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-rfid-hero.webp" alt="RFID inlays and smart labels" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>UHF inlays</span><span>HF inlays</span><span>Asset-tracking tags</span><span>Temperature-sensing tags</span><span>Smart cards</span><span>RFID tire tags</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why RFID buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Extensive RFID manufacturing and design services</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Hana manufactures RFID cards, tags, inlays and specialized formats across LF, HF and UHF, with encoding, converting and test integrated into the production flow. Automated roll-to-roll lines support volume manufacturing, while production capability in China and the USA provides additional capacity and supply-continuity options. Hana's UHF tag range also carries independent Auburn ARC certification.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Full breadth</div><p>Cards, tags, inlays and specialized RFID formats across LF, HF and UHF, including asset-tracking, logistics, temperature-sensing and battery-assisted passive applications.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Automated at volume</div><p>Automated roll-to-roll inlay production with in-line test and encoding, supported by Auburn ARC certification for selected UHF tag products.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>RFID manufacturing in China and the USA provides additional production capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-cards"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Contactless smart card and inlay &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Card Manufacturing</div><p>Contactless smart cards and credentials manufactured from inlay through lamination, printing, encoding and personalization, with automated production supporting high-volume programs.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ RFID inlay web on the roll-to-roll line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</div><p>UHF and HF inlays and straps, ruggedized and rubber-embeddable tags, on-metal formats, temperature-sensing tags and battery-assisted passive products.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Rubber-embeddable RFID tire tag &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Tire Tags</div><p>Rubber-embeddable UHF tire tags manufactured for integration into the tire structure. Detailed construction and application information is covered in the Automotive market section.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:1080px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body" style="max-width:1080px;">RFID manufacturing runs across Hana sites in China and the USA, with automated inlay production at both locations. Programs can be supported across multiple sites where additional manufacturing capacity or supply continuity is required. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from RFID engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures contactless smart cards, UHF and HF inlays and straps, ruggedized and temperature-sensing tags, battery-assisted passive products and rubber-embeddable tire tags across LF, HF and UHF.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How long has Hana manufactured RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana has more than 20 years of RFID design and manufacturing experience, supported by automated roll-to-roll production and independent Auburn ARC certification for selected UHF tag products.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites make RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">RFID manufacturing runs in China at Jiaxing, with six automated inlay lines, and in the USA at Ohio for UHF/HF inlays and straps.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana make RFID tire tags?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana manufactures rubber-embeddable UHF tire tags for integration into the tire structure. Detailed construction and application information is covered on the <a href="/markets/automotive/rfid-tire-tags">Automotive</a> page.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an RFID build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us the form factor, the band and the volume. We will point you to the right site and lines, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>